// LearnSphere - what actually runs today (cloud-architecture-diagram)
// Verified against docker-compose.yml and the service sources.

title LearnSphere - Current Local Topology

Browser [icon: monitor]

Apps [color: blue, label: "Runs via make start"] {
  Frontend [icon: nextjs, label: "frontend :3000"]
  Backend [icon: nodejs, label: "backend :5000 - auth + courses + videos"]
  Transcoder [icon: nodejs, label: "video-transcoder :7000 - no DB"]
  Notify [icon: java, label: "notification-service :8085 - scaffold"]
  Order [icon: java, label: "order-service :8086 - scaffold only"]
}

Infra [color: green, label: "docker compose up -d"] {
  Postgres [icon: postgresql, label: "Postgres :5434 - testDB"]
  Redis [icon: redis, label: "Redis :6379"]
  Kafka [icon: kafka, label: "Kafka KRaft :9092"]
  Mongo [icon: mongodb, label: "Mongo :27017"]
  LocalStack [icon: aws, label: "LocalStack :4566 - s3 sqs sns"]
}

UIs [color: gray, label: "Dev UIs"] {
  KafkaUI [icon: monitor, label: "Kafka UI :8080"]
  MongoExpress [icon: monitor, label: "Mongo Express :8081"]
  RedisInsight [icon: monitor, label: "RedisInsight :5540"]
}

Browser > Frontend
Frontend > Backend: axios + httpOnly cookie
Frontend > Transcoder: HLS playback
Backend > Postgres: Prisma
Backend > Redis: OTP + session
Backend > LocalStack: presign + put
Backend > Kafka: video.uploaded
Kafka > Transcoder: consume
Transcoder > LocalStack: download raw, upload HLS
Transcoder > Backend: processed callback
Notify > Mongo
Notify > Redis
Notify > Kafka
KafkaUI > Kafka
MongoExpress > Mongo
RedisInsight > Redis
